          "text": "Mkukomboleka kumlamula mundu jwa cilendo kuti apwatice cakonjecesya pakuwusya ngongole, nambo ngaŵa mu Isalaeli mjenu. Mlipikanicisye lilamusi lyeleli, ni AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu takayipe upile yindu yosope yitimkatende mcilambo cimkuja kutamaco.",
