        {
          "text": "“Naga mli mkwenda mwitala, lyakupitila mu mgunda wa mipeleya wa mlongo mjenu jwakuŵandikana najo, mkukomboleka kulya yisogosi ya mipeleyayo mli mu mgunda pemo naga mli msacile. Nambo mkajigala yisogosi yine pakutyoka. ",
